============================================================

The ShoppingAgent MUST receive a capability-scoped tool set.

Allowed Phase 1 capabilities:

- product_search
- product_details
- price_lookup
- offer_lookup
- availability_lookup
- review_lookup
- provider_link

Not allowed:

- payment execution
- user account mutation
- arbitrary HTTP requests
- secret access
- database administration
- arbitrary code execution
- provider credential access
- financial transaction execution

Tool access must be enforced by the backend, not merely described in the prompt.

