============================================================

The ShoppingAgent is invoked by LangGraph only when the complexity gate determines that reasoning is useful.

Examples:

"iPhone 17"
→ SIMPLE
→ no ShoppingAgent required

"Compare iPhone 17 and Galaxy S26"
→ MODERATE
→ ShoppingAgent may be invoked

"Find me the best laptop under ₹1 lakh for AI development, prioritize GPU and battery and optimize my payment method"
→ COMPLEX
